](/wiki/Ancient_Greek "Ancient Greek") , which means  [90]  "speechlessness",
[132]  derived from ἄφατος _aphatos_ , "speechless"  [133]  from ἀ- _a-_ ,
"not, un" and φημί _phemi_ , "I speak".

